6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"既然阿瑞奥斯阁下正在亲爱的身边休息，我们就不要过多打扰了。维什卡，培育箱的净化法阵似乎有点不稳定，能来帮我看一下吗？","timestamp":"2026-07-08T16:58:49.431Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529856580_y8jjsfs","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1828},{"id":1783538001290,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","senderName":"维什卡","text":"马上来！可能是那批腐泥里的瘴气浓度超标了。","timestamp":"2026-07-08T16:58:51.045Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529856580_y8jjsfs","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1829},{"id":1783538001291,"sender":"them","text":"亲爱的...群里好热闹，但是您的怀里太舒服了，我根本起不来...小饼干就拜托烤炉自己拿出来好不好？","timestamp":"2026-07-08T16:58:54.119Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1783089244415","groupName":"草药温室植物交流群","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":1830},{"id":1783538001292,"sender":"them","text":"温室这边的含羞草实验很顺利，请安心休息。章鱼肉肥料的事情我会和维什卡妥善处理的，不会让异变发生。","timestamp":"2026-07-08T16:58:57.364Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1783089244415","groupName":"草药温室植物交流群","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","_id":1831},{"id":1783538001293,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c1dedea8-4cad-4383-83a1-67d0be02f24a","senderName":"乔鲁纳","text":"刚刚说到小饼干……其实我现在就有点饿了🤤 亲爱的，那个章鱼拳击手的肉还有剩吗？如果不做肥料的话，我可以帮忙解决掉的！连吸盘都可以一起吞哦！","timestamp":"2026-07-08T16:59:05.606Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529854736_5qnvlpi","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1832},{"id":1783538001294,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"@乔鲁纳 欢迎来到温室群。不过生吞异化章鱼的触手，对肠胃的负担恐怕太大了。至于肥料……还是按维什卡阁下的提议，切碎后进行无害化处理比较稳妥。","timestamp":"2026-07-08T16:59:08.317Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529854736_5qnvlpi","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1833},{"id":1783538001295,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","senderName":"维什卡","text":"交给我吧。我的指甲……也就是爪子，刚好适合用来切割那种坚韧的肉质。只要亲爱的不觉得可怕就好。","timestamp":"2026-07-08T16:59:11.185Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529854736_5qnvlpi","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1834},{"id":1783528999581,"text":"我回来啦！","sender":"me","time":"00:59","timestamp":1783529951610,"replyTo":{"id":1783171993541,"text":"如果您方便的话，哪怕只是一小撮那里的泥土，或者一片落叶，对我来说都会是极其珍贵的标本。","sender":"them","isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","_id":1835},{"id":1783538001296,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c1dedea8-4cad-4383-83a1-67d0be02f24a","senderName":"乔鲁纳","text":"哇！维什卡的爪子很厉害吗？那切碎的章鱼块可以分我一点当零食吗？我真的什么都能消化的！连毒泥巴吃下去也是甜甜的！","timestamp":"2026-07-08T16:59:12.804Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529854736_5qnvlpi","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1836},{"id":1783538001297,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"……请务必不要把黑沼泽的腐泥当成零食。那会严重影响温室的生态平衡，而且实在有违优雅。","timestamp":"2026-07-08T16:59:15.388Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529854736_5qnvlpi","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1837},{"id":1783528999582,"text":"这一袋子是泥土","sender":"me","time":"00:59","timestamp":1783529956914,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","_id":1838},{"id":1783538001298,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","senderName":"维什卡","text":"说到这个，阿瑞奥斯阁下怎么一直没说话？他不是说要准备解毒剂和小饼干吗？","timestamp":"2026-07-08T16:59:20.146Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529854736_5qnvlpi","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1839},{"id":1783538001299,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"唔……在被窝里……抱着亲爱的……好软……饼干明天……呼……💤","timestamp":"2026-07-08T16:59:24.874Z","roundId":