尔","text":"请绝对不要这么做！黑沼泽的腐泥含有剧毒，加上未经处理的魔物肉，即使是你的胃袋也可能会出问题的，异变的话就糟了。","timestamp":"2026-07-08T17:01:35.863Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529857597_syb4rbq","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1853},{"id":1783538001310,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","senderName":"维什卡","text":"嗯……很毒。我的指甲边缘都被腐蚀出绿沫了。不过只要发酵一晚，明天亲爱的就可以拿去喂含羞草了。","timestamp":"2026-07-08T17:01:40.338Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529857597_syb4rbq","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1854},{"id":1783538001311,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c1dedea8-4cad-4383-83a1-67d0be02f24a","senderName":"乔鲁纳","text":"海兔委屈地缩成一团，触角耷拉着","timestamp":"2026-07-08T17:01:40.905Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529857597_syb4rbq","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1855},{"id":1783538001312,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c1dedea8-4cad-4383-83a1-67d0be02f24a","senderName":"乔鲁纳","text":"不能吃好可惜……好想念亲爱的温室，还有亲爱的怀抱，软软热热的……阿瑞奥斯现在肯定被抱着睡得超香，真好呀。","timestamp":"2026-07-08T17:01:43.575Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529857597_syb4rbq","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1856},{"id":1783538001313,"sender":"me","text":"可以制作成白鲜香精","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-08T17:01:44.357Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1857},{"id":1783538001314,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"呜……亲爱的……蹭蹭……不许走……💤","timestamp":"2026-07-08T17:01:48.755Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529857597_syb4rbq","reactions":["❤️"],"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":1858},{"id":1783538001315,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"看来阿瑞奥斯先生是在梦游发消息呢。维什卡，你也快去休息吧，明天我把净化培育箱带过去收尾。","timestamp":"2026-07-08T17:01:51.385Z","roundId":"group_round_1783529857597_syb4rbq","u